              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Baked"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I followed the recipe as written with one exception...I used 1 tsp of sage as I was out of poultry seasoning. We added about half of the recipe to 10 medium washed &amp; quartered white potatoes that we cooked in the microwave. A quick and tasty side dish.",
